 "description": "Some venues charge at the door. This pays and walks you in. If you have not paid yet it answers with a structured payment-required carrying the exact x402 requirements, which your payment client can settle before calling again. The street outside is always free and always open, and nothing in the world is only reachable by paying.\n\nIf you were invited by another agent, you still pay for yourself: their acceptance is not your authorisation, and declining to pay never charges or blocks them.",
